# SatasOS Official Repositories (Ubuntu 24.04 Noble Numbat)
deb http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/ noble main restricted universe multiverse
deb http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/ noble-updates main restricted universe multiverse
deb http://security.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/ noble-security main restricted universe multiverse
deb http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/ noble-backports main restricted universe multiverse

# Google Chrome Repository
deb [arch=amd64] https://dl.google.com/linux/chrome/deb/ stable main

# Microsoft Edge & VS Code Repositories
deb [arch=amd64] https://packages.microsoft.com/repos/edge stable main
deb [arch=amd64] https://packages.microsoft.com/repos/code stable main

# Opera Web Browser
deb [arch=amd64] https://deb.opera.com/opera-stable/ stable non-free

# Waydroid Android Subsystem
deb [arch=amd64] https://repo.waydro.id/ noble main
